lectable=\"on\" display=\"block\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>6</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2.</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n</div></div>",
